기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-&nbsp; 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래&nbsp; -</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 신청기간 :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #fae0d4\"><strong>2012. 03. 12(월) ~ 03. 15(목) [4일간]</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 신청</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">대상 : 대학원 박사과정 신입생 및 지도교수 미배정자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청방법 : kit포탈→ 원스톱서비스 로그인→ 학사관리→논문지도→지도교수배정신청</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">지도교수배정 신청 후 반드시 지도교수와 유무선, 이메일로 연락하여 확인을 받으셔야 합니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"